# Medusa Downloader local development

## Docker compose

Run the application locally by authenticating to the AWS CLI ```aws login``` and running  ```docker compose -f docker-compose-development.yml up --build```

Access the downloader aplication at ```http://localhost:3000/```

### AMQP testing locally

To test the downloader with AMQP queues access the AMQP UI at ```http://localhost:15672/```

Authenticate to the AMQP UI with ```downloader:password```

From the apropriate queue send a json request:
```json
{
  "action": "export",
  "return_queue": <return-queue>,
  "root": <root>,
  "zip_name": <zip-name>,
  "client_id": <client-id>,
  "targets": [
    {
      "recursive": <true/false>,
      "type": <file/directory/literal>,
      "path": <key>,
      "zip_path": ""
    }
  ]
}
```